  "releaseNotes": "Enhanced TemplatedTaskLoader events to now pass the actual view created from the ControlTemplate in ControlTemplateLoadedEventArgs. Added GetTemplateChild method to retrieve named children from templates. Events now provide full access to manipulate template views.",
